<title>USA: Wet Seal proposes to buy County Seat.</title>
<headline>Wet Seal proposes to buy County Seat.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Wet Seal Inc said it proposed to buy 508 stores from County Seat and convert those stores to Contempo Casuals or Wet Seal stores.</p>
<p>Ed Thomas, President and Chief Operating Officer of Wet Seal, said Wet Seal made the proposal to representatives of County Seat and various creditor groups, but has not received a response. It said the matter has been referred to Blackstone Group, County Seat's financial advisor.</p>
</text>
